---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About ABC Company"
	description="Building Intelligent Solutions For The Enterprise"
	pubDate={new Date('August 10 2026')}
>
	<p>
		ABC Company is a trusted corporate partner specializing in strategic digital
		solutions. We combine deep industry expertise with modern technology to help
		businesses of all sizes grow with confidence.
	</p>

	<img class="about-hero" src="/images/viora/about/about-1.jpg" alt="ABC Company office" />

	<h3>Our Mission</h3>
	<p>
		To deliver innovative, reliable, and scalable technology that empowers our
		clients to achieve their goals. We believe every business deserves tools that
		are as ambitious as their vision.
	</p>

	<img class="about-image" src="/images/viora/about/why-1.jpg" alt="Why choose ABC Company" />

	<h3>Why Choose Us</h3>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Personalized Plans:</strong> Tailored strategies that fit your unique business needs.</li>
		<li><strong>Proven Results:</strong> Data-driven execution with measurable outcomes.</li>
		<li><strong>Expert Support:</strong> A dedicated team ready to guide you at every step.</li>
	</ul>

	<img class="about-image" src="/images/viora/about/overview-1.jpg" alt="Our services overview" />

	<h3>Our Services</h3>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Business Strategy:</strong> Roadmaps that align technology with your long-term goals.</li>
		<li><strong>Web Development:</strong> High-performance websites and web applications.</li>
		<li><strong>Branding & Identity:</strong> Cohesive visual identities that stand out in the market.</li>
		<li><strong>Digital Marketing:</strong> Campaigns that drive awareness, engagement, and growth.</li>
	</ul>


	<h3>By The Numbers</h3>
	<div class="about-stats">
		<div class="stat"><strong>10</strong><span>Years of Experience</span></div>
		<div class="stat"><strong>250</strong><span>Successful Projects</span></div>
		<div class="stat"><strong>50</strong><span>Corporate Clients</span></div>
		<div class="stat"><strong>98%</strong><span>Client Satisfaction</span></div>
	</div>

	<h3>Contact Us</h3>
	<p>Email: hello@abc-company.example</p>
	<p>Phone: +1 (555) 123-4567</p>

	<style>
		.about-hero {
			width: 100%;
			border-radius: 12px;
			box-shadow: var(--box-shadow);
			margin: 1.5rem 0;
		}
		.about-image {
			width: 100%;
			max-width: 600px;
			border-radius: 12px;
			box-shadow: var(--box-shadow);
			margin: 1.5rem auto;
			display: block;
		}
		.team-row {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
			gap: 1.5rem;
			margin: 1.5rem 0;
		}
		.team-row figure {
			margin: 0;
			text-align: center;
		}
		.team-row img {
			width: 100%;
			border-radius: 12px;
			box-shadow: var(--box-shadow);
		}
		.team-row figcaption {
			margin-top: 0.75rem;
			font-weight: 700;
		}
		.team-row figcaption span {
			font-weight: 400;
			color: rgb(var(--gray));
			font-size: 0.9rem;
		}
		.about-stats {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr));
			gap: 1rem;
			margin: 1.5rem 0;
			padding: 1.5rem;
			background: white;
			border-radius: 8px;
			box-shadow: var(--box-shadow);
		}
		.about-stats .stat {
			text-align: center;
		}
		.about-stats strong {
			display: block;
			font-size: 2rem;
			color: var(--accent);
		}
		.about-stats span {
			font-size: 0.9rem;
			color: rgb(var(--gray));
		}
	</style>
</Layout>
